{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-16_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-16","title":"在熾燃間咆哮","storyCode":"14-18","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"47f0e758c8e183fa0dcff16b243045f75cee209da2977247bb0810d2b095ee9d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"死魂靈消散之際，特蕾西婭終於露面，她救下死魂靈並進入了未知的空間。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"narration","text":"思維的靈光……在黯淡……\n意識……被無序的情緒吞噬殆盡……\n不再感知……不再被感知……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"narration","text":"航行於碎片大廈上空的堡壘最外層開始解體，漫天的碎片如鐵雨般墜向大地。\n龐大的骸骨停在原地，它的神經束緊裹著飛空艇。\n死魂靈最後的思維正在消散……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g10_airshipwitchcraftcore"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭，你向我許下了那個無可置疑的未來……\n而你的追隨者……卻成了你踐行道路的阻礙。\n我同胞們的靈魂因數百年的炙烤而混亂……\n這處熔爐本該成為我的囚籠，是我用以自戕的行刑室——\n我背叛同族的罪孽尚未還清！\n特蕾西婭，這是我最後能做的事……\n暴烈的燃燒。\n陰影在灼燒中消散，火焰包裹著飛空艇周身，撕扯著神經束。\n也撲向你們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"narration","text":"至於你們——\n你們用虛偽的言語將自己放上道德的高地……\n用拯救的謊言來抹平薩卡茲為生存而留下的疤痕……\n你們……甚至不敢面對她的死亡——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你何必來到這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"特蕾西婭？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來，是為了找阿米婭嗎？還是為了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你受傷了……？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你身邊的孩子……是阿米婭？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的答案吧，博士……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你試圖邁步向前，但身體卻無法動彈，眼前的場景與你隔著一道無法觸碰的屏障。\n你終於明白過來，這不是現實——\n這是死魂靈強迫你看到的畫面。\n真實的畫面……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等等……他們是……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到許多身影從你身旁湧上前去……\n你認得那些人的武器與甲胄，你見過他們的背影，就在剛剛……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這些人是飛空艇上的那些幽靈？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"他們是來保護特蕾西婭的嗎？\n不，不是……\n你看到他們將手中的刀揮向了那位受傷的魔王——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i01"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到了自己從未想像過的畫面。\n倒在血泊中的特蕾西婭，緊緊護著懷中熟睡的阿米婭。\n殺死她的兇手正環繞在你的身旁。\n你們是同謀。\n……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是什麼……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"這些畫面一閃而過，意識回到現實。\n你看到W、凱爾希、阿米婭臉上的神色，你意識到，看到剛才畫面的，並不是只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……W……","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"這位危險的雇傭兵此刻冷靜得出奇，她似乎本該憤怒至極。\n但她並沒有。\n她甚至沒有看你一眼，而是緊緊握著手中的炮銃，死死盯著死魂靈的殘影。"}]},{"label":"……凱爾希……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希也正在看著你。\n翠綠色的眼眸一如既往地沉著冷靜，只是比起平常，多了一分悲傷。"}]},{"label":"……阿米婭……","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭怔怔地看向前方，伸出手想抓住什麼。\n可是觸碰到的終究只剩一片虛無。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，請冷靜。站到我和Mon3tr的身後來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如我之前告訴你的，我對於這些過往已經知曉，但也有理由對你保密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認同特蕾西婭當時的選擇，告訴現在的你真相於事無補。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>可是，特蕾西婭。</i>\n<i>現在，在此處，讓死魂靈展現當時的畫面，這同樣是你的選擇嗎？</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，在切爾諾伯格的時候，甚至是在那之後，我都對你尚有懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你已經用一系列的選擇證明了自己，你的確是我們的同行者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜一些，不要動搖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虛偽。\n懦弱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不配用特蕾西婭來挑撥離間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，讓你的怪物離我遠一點。我沒有準備在現在動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，老東西不至於死到臨頭還捏造一段假的電影來騙人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是笨蛋，害死特蕾西婭的兇手，怎麼樣都數不出第二個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年的事總得有一個說法，但殺一個什麼都不記得的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我提不起一點興趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"驚異，疑惑，悲傷。\n無法理解的真相像一柄重錘敲在你的心臟上。\n你遲遲沒有從震驚中緩過神來，兩人冷靜的話語對你來說並不算寬恕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你看向了一直沉默的女孩，她早已滿臉淚痕。\n你想要開口說些什麼，她卻在你之前開了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士……我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該說……我早就猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得……在那場事故之後，凱爾希醫生為什麼要將博士送去切爾諾伯格療傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有在決定去營救博士的時候，那些精英幹員反對的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算所有人都對真正的原因閉口不談，我也可以猜到的。只有這一種可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"………………","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管猜到了，但我還是不理解……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識的博士，那個救了我，帶我走過許多地方，講了許多故事的博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個將我帶回巴別塔，想盡辦法要治好我的礦石病，承諾我可以有未來的博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個善良的人，為什麼會……想要殺死，同樣善良、愛著所有人的特蕾西婭小姐……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不記得了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不知道。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我還有許多問題想問你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救下我的你，謀殺特蕾西婭小姐的你，現在站在這裡的你……到底哪一個，才是真正的Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我始終不知道，怎麼才能對你開口……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從石棺中醒來後，雖然失去了記憶，但無論多麼危險的情況，你始終和我們站在一起……我又該怎麼相信，這樣的你，是那個兇手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我答應你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我一定會找到答案。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你向阿米婭伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"飛空艇的甲板突然開始劇烈地震動，阿米婭立刻抓住了你的手。\n原本聚集在艙內的黑色陰影凌空綻放……\n在緋紅蒼穹的映照下，一朵足以吞噬光明的黑花包裹住了整艘飛空艇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"飛空艇正在崩潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須馬上撤離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那些陰影，試圖堵住我們的路！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，站在我身後——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“崩潰不可無序”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我於此言語，規則於此重構。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"籠罩你們思維的陰影已被驅散。\n金色的咒文衝破了黑色的陰影，落於飛空艇的損毀之處……\n文字在此解構，而後再次塑形，彌合破碎的艦體。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Logos！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，破碎之物自有我處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿越陰影，接應大家的骸骨神經已然就緒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女妖的骨筆自他的手中垂下，落於陰影之上。\n以陰影為帷幕，女妖盡情揮筆將咒文書寫其上。\n金色的脈絡在陰影中流轉，火焰逐漸熄滅……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到神經束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos，我們都準備好撤離了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，抓緊我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"神經束……斷了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你們重新墜入了飛空艇。腳下的船體在震動，死魂靈不再言語。\n陰影環繞流轉在每個人的腳下，彷彿嘲弄著你們。\n白色自結晶化的船體滲出，閃耀著潔淨的光輝。\n溫和。輕盈。安撫了一切的混亂與無序。\n光芒遮掩了陰影，變得越來越刺眼……\n純淨的白芒抹去了周圍的一切色彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨即，自遠處浮現的黑洞又將所有的光明吞噬殆盡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i14_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗。寧靜。\n起初，黑暗中的奇點誕生了最初的光。\n思維的光。情緒的光。新生的光。\n那束微弱的紅光開始生長，膨脹……\n照亮了創造它的那隻手……\n照亮了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i14"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"特蕾西婭……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"她從黑暗中走來……不，她一直都在那裡。\n只是此刻，她選擇短暫地將目光落在你們的身上。\n在她的懷抱之中，死魂靈潰散的意識重新凝聚。\n所有的悲傷，所有的不甘，所有的憤怒……\n在她的撫慰之下都消散而去，死魂靈終於回歸了平靜。\n她將被死亡背棄的同胞抱在了懷中，她帶來新生，她改寫命運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"特蕾西婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有回應，但你從她的眼神中讀出了異樣的訊息……\n你不敢確認。\n你們所有人都因為她的出現而屏息，所有人都期待她將要吐露的第一句言語。\n寂靜。\n但她什麼也沒說，轉身隱入了黑暗之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"narration","text":"她彷彿從未來過，這裡沒有留下任何痕跡。\n但所有人都清楚，她……終於出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是漏聽了殿下的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，飛空艇又動了？！而且還在全速前進？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個老東西不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們離“阿喃那”太近了，飛空艇上已經是富源石環境，而這裡的所有源石，都在為飛空艇供能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神經束的連接，斷了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"舷窗外，那個宏大的巫術巨構已經脫離了神經束的束縛，正在以難以追趕的速度駛向天空中的“阿喃那”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷！你怎麼醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迫降……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸……在“生命脊椎”中留下了最後一絲活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將它迫降在……倫蒂尼姆城內，安全的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W他們還在飛空艇上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經……向凱爾希醫生……還有博士……承諾過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡可能……挽救更多生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能……盡力而為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"許多人都這樣稱呼過你。\n“巴別塔的惡靈”“羅德島的博士”。\n許多人都相信你，相信你總是可以做出正確的選擇，無論多麼絕望的境地，你都能找出萬中無一的生路。\n但是——\n你遠非全能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g9_airshipdeck"},{"type":"narration","text":"這一切都在電光石火間發生。\n特蕾西婭沒有再出現，也帶走了所有的陰影。\n越是靠近苦難的搖籃，結晶化就承加迅速。\n當陰影的浪潮徹底退去之後，你終於看到，結晶化的痕跡早已布滿整艘飛空艇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你的同伴依然站在你的身邊，他們都是強大的戰士，但在這命定般的災難面前，所有人都無能為力。\n飛空艇仍在以不可阻擋的態勢撞向“阿喃那”——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"停滯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"飛空艇即將接觸“阿喃那”的瞬間，原本全速前行的龐然大物卻陷入了靜滯。\n時間都已停滯。\n巨大的樹狀源石結構迅速生長出新的枝椏，牢牢抓住了飛空艇。\n繁茂的源石自枝頭飛速蔓延，吞噬包裹飛空艇。\n你看到，所有人停滯於那一刻。\n你看到，源石在瘋長。\n你看到，阿米婭焦急地向你伸出手——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的時間停滯在了那一刻，你甚至能看到她正在呼喊你的名字。\n但純淨的源石以恐怖的速度覆蓋了她的身體，那一聲呼喚甚至沒能來得及發出。\n蔓延。\n你向她奔去，可怎麼也不夠快。\n吞噬。\n你看到，源石即將吞噬她的最後一部分身體……\n阿米婭！\n你竭力伸出手，想要抓住她……就差一點……\n你再也無法拉住她的手。\n龐雜的訊息流自你的腦海中呼嘯而過——\n你好像看到了一個完全源石化的寧靜世界。\n阿米婭……凱爾希……Logos……W……\n羅德島的一切，倫蒂尼姆的一切，戰場上的一切，泰拉的一切——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"不，這絕不是你想看到的……\n你怎能允許這一切發生。\n停下……停下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"停下！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>你做到了，Dr.{@nickname}。</color>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
